    "scenesThatPass": [
      "WICKED: FOR GOOD\nMORRIBLE: Citizens of Oz. There’ve been 12 tide turnings since the Wicked Witch of the West escaped with our Grimmerie. Shield your children. Trust no…",
      "GLINDA: Shouldn’t this be pinker?\nSHENSHEN: I... don’t know what to say. I’m so sorry.",
      "GLINDA: Madame Morrible! Forgive me for keeping you waiting, I--\nGLINDA: Has something happened? Is it-- Elphaba?\nMORRIBLE: You mean, the Wicked Witch.",
      "GLINDA: Is that supposed to happen?\nMORRIBLE: It’s alright.\nGLINDA: Are you sure?\nGLINDA: Does that do what I think it does?",
      "ELPHABA: It’s true!\nELPHABA: I cast that spell. And I-- I have to live with that, but--\nELPHABA: But if I’d known I was being tricked, and why, I’d never have--\nELPHABA: Wait-- don’t go!"
    ]
